dist-site/
# Marketing/hero renders of the OG card (the living-still hero mp4 + its compressed .webp
# poster, plus any full-size source) — built on demand from the owner's asset ($0 CSS+ffmpeg
# pipeline in C:\Users\Kuya\tools\og-capture); owner picks usage. Only the 1200x630 og.png
# ships in git (committed + deployed for og:image); the hero assets ride into dist-site/ at
# deploy-assembly time. The glob also catches og-card-poster.webp (no dot after "og-card").
site/assets/og-card*
